  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;﻿The application does not include a Unilateral Undertaking or a Section 106 securing a financial contribution regarding affordable housing, carbon off-setting,&amp;nbsp; and car free development contrary to Policies LP55, LP13, LP45 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) Policy T6 of the London Plan (2021) and the S106 Planning Contributions Supplementary Planning Document (2020).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-d21b3578-7fff-762d-d2f9-bcbdcf0c0c4b&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal would create an additional unit that would not be of high quality design failing to comply with space standards regarding ceiling heights, providing no private outdoor amenity space and failing to provide any accessible accommodation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;resulting in substandard accommodation for future occupiers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;. The proposal is therefore considered contrary to The Greater London Authority Housing SPG (2016), Technical Housing Standards – Nationally Described Space Standard (2015), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;LP1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; LP17, LP22, of The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;D4, D6 and D7 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-38e59b1f-7fff-5258-1158-69e928791ba8&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The energy statement provided states that air source heat pumps will be utilised on the site however no details of these air source heat pumps have been provided in regards to technical specifications or their location. The application therefore does not provide sufficient evidence that it would have no significant impact on neighbouring dwellings amenity contrary to Policy LP2 of the LP33.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal would result in the loss of a 4+ bedroom family sized unit within the Stamford Hill AAP area and therefore would result in an imbalance of larger family houses and have a harmful effect on the Borough’s housing supply. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Policy AAP1 of the Stamford Hill Area Action Plan and LP14 &amp;amp; LP19 of the&amp;nbsp; Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
  "decision": "Refused",
